# Picking words where they are (MessagePick.kt): held still on the agent's words, the word under the finger is picked,
# the bar over it (引用, 复制, 全选); 复制 copies just that word (已复制); held again and widened by sliding on, the
# passage quoted (引用) and sent: the quote is that passage, not the whole message.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
wait 1000
tap 发消息
type 说一句长一点的话 {T} post:选词测试 {T} 这一句话里有好几个可以单独选中的词语
tap icon:arrow-up
timeout 120000
untiln 2 选词测试 {T}
until 归档此对话
timeout 60000
wait 1500
hold 700 可以单独选中的词语
until =复制
shot 1-word
tap =复制
until =已复制
gone =复制
hold 700 可以单独选中的词语
until =引用
shot 2-picked
tap =引用
until 添加说明
shot 3-quoted
tap 发消息
type 引用了一个词 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
until 引用了一个词 {T}
gone 正在发送
